WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Our next section will focus on bodily injuries.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
While our last section dealt specifically with blood loss,

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
here we are going to explore how to identify and treat a variety of other physical traumas

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
that can happen to the body.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
As we discuss these, keep in mind that the severity of these injuries can vary quite a bit.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Some might need 911 right away, while others you may be able to treat safely on site.

